body:
This app is a live saver for any fellow out there who’s neurodivergent.
I did not leave 5 stars since in my opinion it needs a few improvements such as:
- a widget, to be able to access the to do list more easily and quickly;
-a dark mode would be useful and easier on the eyes;
- more accessibility, particularly more language options (such as Italian, French, Spanish, German etc);
I will probably update this review in a few months.
Thanks for reading.
I apologize in advance for any mistake in my grammar or things like that, English is not my native language.😅
Greetings from Italy! 🇮🇹❤️
